{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sobha-the-s-tower-dubai-internet-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":475,"crm_id":"534","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"The S Tower","slug":"sobha-the-s-tower-dubai-internet-city","display_address":"Dubai Internet City","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":14500000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0998016,"longitude":55.1682864,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>The S Tower - a flagship project by Sobha Realty, located in Dubai Internet City. The tower has 62 floors, rises 229 meters above the city and offers luxury apartments with <strong>4 and 5 bedrooms</strong>. Each residence offers stunning views of the sea, Palm Jumeirah and the cityscape. The design of the complex is made in a modern style, the interiors use natural high quality materials in soft white and beige colors, which creates an atmosphere of elegance and comfort.</p><p>On the territory of the complex each resident will be able to find something to his/her liking. There is a large infinity pool, equipped gym, health SPA-center, sauna, children's playground. Near the complex are Dubai Knowledge Park and Royal Park, with many places for recreation, jogging and biking paths and barbecue areas. There are cafes, restaurants, stores, supermarkets, as well as kindergartens, schools and medical centers within walking distance.</p><p>The S Tower is located on Sheikh Zayed Road, one of Dubai's main thoroughfares, allowing for quick access to the city's main attractions. Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, Emirates Golf Course, Mall of Emirates and Ibn Battuta Shopping Mall are just a 10-minute drive away, while Downtown Dubai, Riverland Dubai, Legoland Dubai, DXB and DWC International Airports are about 20 minutes away.</p><p>The S Tower is a model of comfort, luxury and coziness. The complex is ideal for young couples, families with children and businessmen interested in a premium standard of living in the center of the metropolis, and investors will be able to receive a high income from the rental of apartments in short or long term rentals</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/534/images/2023/11/01/sLz0VkV9bBuDBSq8zMNSrYb2AKIth4217GpT0a4n.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/01/sLz0VkV9bBuDBSq8zMNSrYb2AKIth4217GpT0a4n.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/534/images/2023/11/01/SiEwZYFjEPEunDMiWpaKsDt64kzdz7GjYk6iVt8E.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/01/SiEwZYFjEPEunDMiWpaKsDt64kzdz7GjYk6iVt8E.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/534/images/2023/11/01/g8Mlce9hdmVykNvsDn82wVhbaqMbhFM9KgKBXnPM.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/01/g8Mlce9hdmVykNvsDn82wVhbaqMbhFM9KgKBXnPM.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2013,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/the_s_tower_brochure_38484ee020.pdf","hash":"the_s_tower_brochure_38484ee020","name":"The S Tower Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1264,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"60/40","payment_plans":[{"id":6245,"title":"20%","description":"On booking"},{"id":6246,"title":"40%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":6248,"title":"40%","description":"On handover"}],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":10562,"url":null,"text":"Concierge Service","type":null,"